│ GET     │ https://<storage_endpoint>/data/7f14bb06-f57a-42b4-ba7f-053a65152759-m0.avro                             │ OK_200             │
│ GET     │ https://<storage_endpoint>/data/71f8b43d-51e7-40e7-be88-e8d869836ecd-deletes.parq…                       │ PartialContent_206 │
